 "id": "1351915563790360", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499294643_1351915567123693_193668259235143392_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=5UtCzp56ESYQ7kNvwE3R3o3&_nc_oc=AdrAcG9AA_EivCCDnmcXxiTN89gsykBZtmgsKt6KUoVk5SnB4aVyjxGuaEAeiipR-x8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIy6E13t5nmYCEd0RjJuUb6qHc8crVTAROofFPrU9bVTA&oe=6AA018CE"}, {"file_name": "1.png", "id": "1046113377914823", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499296209_1046113381248156_1179824598871506598_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=SjZFcHUOsJkQ7kNvwFoLuvS&_nc_oc=Adrv-9jLT8Bn-FtbiPTT418uZemuTAW81MsTdOuBZCKQsYqTCjoHTtlJkFEcLkhoEgg&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK9dMN-B5hyy-RQhgtGn6QolcRppans90Uxk0VvzbdNVw&oe=6AA0208D"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "miniatura.png", "id": "2548028058950465", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499300993_2548028062283798_7954129199783617214_n.png?_nc_cat=104&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=xFg5nlKm_28Q7kNvwFMiKNf&_nc_oc=Adr2tXoy-e2yYjSOOlaBIS4iCrAF1l98UUnTj27TTpjzfTNyrajSFJOsHUW_XvyGTyc&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQKv5barps5u2vsMyeeDaNbpCzSXnTkhyxcbckv-kku0fA&oe=6AA00516"}, "display_name": "P\u00e1sele Joven", "keywords": ["Simulation", "Cooking", "Comedy", "Mexican", "Casual"], "long_description": "P\u00e1sele Joven: Taquer\u00eda in VR\n\nPut on the headset and let's fire up the taco stand. In P\u00e1sele Joven\nyou are the one behind your own Mexican taco stand: you slice the\nmeat off the al pastor spit, warm up the tortilla just right, grind\nsalsa in the molcajete with the tejolote, build the taco and hand it\nover before the customer completely loses his marbles.\n\nThree tacos, two kinds of tortilla\n\nTaco al pastor \u2014 corn tortilla with pastor meat\nTaco de chorizo \u2014 corn tortilla with chorizo\nTaco \u00e1rabe \u2014 flour tortilla for the \u00e1rabe meat\n\nYes, the tortilla matters. If you serve a pastor on a flour tortilla\nthe plate gets rejected at delivery, and don't you dare forget the\nlime to tie it all together \u2014 otherwise it's not a real taco, right\namigo?\n\nThe molcajete and the salsas\n\nFixed molcajete station with a grabbable tejolote. Drop ingredients\ninto the molcajete and grind by moving the tejolote with your own\nhands. You can make two kinds of salsa:\n\nRed salsa: tomato + chiles + onion + garlic + salt\nGreen salsa: tomatillo + chiles + onion + garlic + cilantro + salt\n\nServe the salsa with the spoon: grab it, bring it to the molcajete\nand pour it over the taco you just prepped. Drop in ingredients that\ndon't match any recipe? Wasted \u2014 just like your time, buddy.\n\nTwo game modes\n\nInfinite Mode: never ends. Perfect for cranking out tacos with zero\npressure.\n\nLives Mode: start with 3 lives. Every customer who walks away\nunfed costs you one. Hit zero and it's over, pal.", "short_description": "Fire up those spits \u2014 in P\u00e1sele Joven you're the taquero running an\nauthentic Mexican taquer\u00eda in VR. Slice fresh limes, roast chiles for\nthe salsa, grind it in the molcajete and juggle customers whose\npatience runs shorter than your prep time.\n\nA VR game with real Mexican heart and humor, packed with mechanics\nthat'll make you sweat bullets. Can you handle 30 rounds?\n\nCome on in, amigo \u2014 you're gonna love it. How could you not?"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://kaanforge.com/gaming/pasele-joven/privacidad", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Kaan Forge Solutions", "support_website_url": "https://kaanforge.com/contacto", "website_url": "https://kaanforge.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "3315291881322